\subsection*{Machine Learning for RE}

Machine learning (ML) is a statistical approach for data analysis, machine intelligence, and pattern recognition. It is a key technology for RE, and this section reviews ML methods for RE, starting with traditional machine learning, proceeding through deep learning and reinforcement learning, and concluding with the latest research on NLP and RE models.

